s/123976","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123976","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123976.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123976.patch","merged_at":"2026-09-30T16:57:13Z"},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Closes #123943\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nCalling `scriptType.GetNestedType(\"GodotInternal\")` returns a generic type definition, even though `scriptType` itself is a constructed generic type.\r\n\r\nWe can't use `MakeGenericType` either as it's not AOT compatible.\r\n\r\nAs a workaround, we generate a static method in the script class, to return `typeof(GodotInternal)`, which returns a constructed generic type within this context.\r\n\r\nThis can be removed later, once #118932 is merged, as that PR accesses the trampoline getters directly instead of through reflection.\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123976/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"roc